		 alt="My Picture" width="400" height="330"
		 />
		<div class="content">
			<h1 class="h1"> My Blah</h1>
			<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Beatae sint magni laborum error quos iste voluptatibus tenetur, impedit officiis inventore aliquid incidunt velit similique deleniti culpa amet dignissimos fuga in unde possimus nisi magnam saepe, quasi atque? Tenetur, autem animi?

			</p>
			<Link href="mailto*blabla"
			style="primary" text="Contact Me"
			/>
		</div>
	</section>
</MainLayout>


<style>
html, body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
   ;
  font-family: "Noto Serif JP", serif;

}

h1 {
	color: purple;
	font-size: 4rem;
}
